Answer: Yes, Nate McMurray served as Town Supervisor of Grand Island, though the location is Grand Island, N.Y. (New York), not Nebraska as stated in the claim. The search result confirms this, noting "Grand Island Town Supervisor Nate McMurray will formally announce his candidacy for Congress" in January 2018.

